        "id": "v2-proposal-j7-223210-root",
        "type": "question",
        "label": null,
        "prompt": "4 workers take 1 day to paint a fence of area $50\\text{ m}^2$. Each worker is paid $\\$160$ per day. Find the cost of painting:",
        "children": [
         {
          "id": "v2-proposal-j7-223210-j7-gp-a",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "a",
          "prompt": "a fence of area $250\\text{ m}^2$ using 5 workers.",
          "answerSpaceMm": 50,
          "answer": {
           "short": "$\\$3200$",
           "worked": "The fence is $250\\div50=5$ times the area, so 4 workers take 5 days.\n$$\\begin{align*}t&=\\frac{k}{N}\\\\5&=\\frac{k}{4}\\\\k&=20\\\\t&=\\frac{20}{5}=4\\\\C&=5\\times4\\times160\\\\C&=3200\\end{align*}$$\nIt costs $\\$3200$."
          },
          "questionDiagrams": []
         },
         {
          "id": "v2-proposal-j7-223210-j7-gp-b",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "b",
          "prompt": "a fence of area $100\\text{ m}^2$ using 8 workers.",
          "answerSpaceMm": 50,
          "answer": {
           "short": "$\\$1280$",
           "worked": "The fence is $100\\div50=2$ times the area, so 4 workers take 2 days.\n$$\\begin{align*}t&=\\frac{k}{N}\\\\2&=\\frac{k}{4}\\\\k&=8\\\\t&=\\frac{8}{8}=1\\\\C&=8\\times1\\times160\\\\C&=1280\\end{align*}$$\nIt costs $\\$1280$."
          },
          "questionDiagrams": []
         },
         {
          "id": "v2-proposal-j7-223210-j7-gp-c",
          "type": "part",
          "label": "c",
          "prompt": "a fence of area $150\\text{ m}^2$ that must be finished in 2 days.",
          "answerSpaceMm": 55,
          "answer": {
           "short": "$\\$1920$ (6 workers)",
           "worked": "The fence is $150\\div50=3$ times the area, so 4 workers take 3 days.\n$$\\begin{align*}t&=\\frac{k}{N}\\\\3&=\\frac{k}{4}\\\\k&=12\\\\2&=\\frac{12}{N}\\\\N&=6\\\\C&=6\\times2\\times160\\\\C&=1920\\end{align*}$$\nIt needs 6 workers and costs $\\$1920$."
          },
          "questionDiagrams": []
         }
        ],
